{"answer":null,"concept_id":"cuda-graph-capture-limits","content_sha256":"sha256:78964853731d88c4abe7e6ba48229c18679e0c86276127b4851bd8a2870f4e4d","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789332404.298974,"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"capture 把一段流操作固化为静态图：host 侧条件与循环不会成为图节点，动态 shape 是根本障碍（推理框架按 batch/序列长度 bucket 预捕获多张图来绕开），分配的内存地址必须稳定（图内存池），否则回放会踩到失效地址。","id":"q-operator-cuda-graph-capture-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"捕获期间的主机逻辑（条件/循环/回调）不会进入图，动态 shape 要按档位分别捕获，节点用到的内存地址要稳定（图内存池），跨图复用要理清流与事件语义"},{"id":"b","text":"任意 Python 控制流都能原样捕获进图"},{"id":"c","text":"图捕获之后可以随意增删节点"},{"id":"d","text":"捕获时不需要考虑流的依赖关系"}],"prompt":"用 stream capture 生成 CUDA Graph 时，哪些限制必须注意？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"engineering","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA CUDA C++ Programming Guide","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-programming-guide/"},{"kind":"public_interview_topic","title":"NVIDIA CUDA interview topics","url":"https://huru.ai/nvidia-interview-questions-mastering-cuda-inference-systems"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"runtime","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
